== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|a+}} Super Magnet's sprite was changed for [[Booster Packs|Booster Pack #5]].
* Super magnets, also known as [[wikipedia:Neodymium magnet|neodymium magnets]], are magnets made of an iron, boron, and neodymium alloy (Nd<sub>2</sub>Fe<sub>14</sub>B). They are more powerful compared to the ordinary ferrite magnets, made of iron oxide.

